{"4333430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Apartment", "steam_appid": 4333430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A new apartment. A friendly neighbor. Problems with your deliveries. <br><strong>Welcome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/f7b1fd3a48de1a77643681fcc351b77b.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/f7b1fd3a48de1a77643681fcc351b77b.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/f7b1fd3a48de1a77643681fcc351b77b.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You move in. You unpack. You follow a simple daily rhythm. Your neighbor greets you. He seems polite. Attentive.<br><br>A little too attentive. He knows what you ordered. He asks you to share. At first, it sounds like a joke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dd15124ad734345d1c1701b38be7be2d.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dd15124ad734345d1c1701b38be7be2d.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dd15124ad734345d1c1701b38be7be2d.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The nights are quiet.<br>The days are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/e7c16ff7e0e625474f8430ec841ecc73.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/e7c16ff7e0e625474f8430ec841ecc73.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/e7c16ff7e0e625474f8430ec841ecc73.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The neighbor is getting mad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/58e32aace074458e5b7e0b110a09d199.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/58e32aace074458e5b7e0b110a09d199.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/58e32aace074458e5b7e0b110a09d199.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A siren breaks the silence. A countdown starts. Every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dce8e91cbd342a282954355a8cf49db0.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dce8e91cbd342a282954355a8cf49db0.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dce8e91cbd342a282954355a8cf49db0.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don’t disappoint him.</strong><br><br>Find out what’s happening by exploring the apartments. Or become part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/c01f427e53439c51374cf259501de3ea.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/c01f427e53439c51374cf259501de3ea.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/c01f427e53439c51374cf259501de3ea.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Apartment</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience built around observation, tension, and repetition.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving and pattern recognition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based gameplay with countdown and code-decoding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single location with distinct surreal and realistic states</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environment that changes behavior and rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analog horror and VHS aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all of them let you survive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A new apartment. A friendly neighbor. Problems with your deliveries. <br><strong>Welcome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/f7b1fd3a48de1a77643681fcc351b77b.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/f7b1fd3a48de1a77643681fcc351b77b.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/f7b1fd3a48de1a77643681fcc351b77b.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You move in. You unpack. You follow a simple daily rhythm. Your neighbor greets you. He seems polite. Attentive.<br><br>A little too attentive. He knows what you ordered. He asks you to share. At first, it sounds like a joke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dd15124ad734345d1c1701b38be7be2d.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dd15124ad734345d1c1701b38be7be2d.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dd15124ad734345d1c1701b38be7be2d.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The nights are quiet.<br>The days are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/e7c16ff7e0e625474f8430ec841ecc73.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/e7c16ff7e0e625474f8430ec841ecc73.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/e7c16ff7e0e625474f8430ec841ecc73.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The neighbor is getting mad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/58e32aace074458e5b7e0b110a09d199.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/58e32aace074458e5b7e0b110a09d199.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/58e32aace074458e5b7e0b110a09d199.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A siren breaks the silence. A countdown starts. Every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dce8e91cbd342a282954355a8cf49db0.poster.avif?t=1787665180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dce8e91cbd342a282954355a8cf49db0.webm?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333430/extras/dce8e91cbd342a282954355a8cf49db0.mp4?t=1787665180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don’t disappoint him.</strong><br><br>Find out what’s happening by exploring the apartments. Or become part of